==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] trivializes the stage, but if you lack her, you're gonna have to use the good ol' [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and meatshield strategy. The enemies are often in small packs, making it rather easy to kill them.

==Trivia==
*This stage's name is a reference to [[Wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]], specifically the message a player recieves when their Pokémon is about to evolve.

